DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
8102::$$$message_0058_0000_0000$$$::"Senpai, thank you for waiting!"[lr]::
8103::$$$message_0058_0000_0001$$$::The ribbon that holds her hair together sways like a feather.[lr]::
8104::$$$message_0058_0000_0002$$$::Sakura comes trotting over in a hurry, like a baby bird who has found its parent.::
8105::$$$message_0058_0001_0000$$$::"It took a while, since I was treating an injured member."[lr]::
8106::$$$message_0058_0001_0001$$$::"I see. You have it hard, Captain."[lr]::
8107::$$$message_0058_0001_0002$$$::I didn't know she was living up to her duties as the kyudo club captain that much.[lr]::
8108::$$$message_0058_0001_0003$$$::"Breaking out of one's shell" is the perfect phrase to describe the current Sakura.::
8109::$$$message_0058_0002_0000$$$::"What do you wanna do? Stop by Shinto?"[lr]::
8110::$$$message_0058_0002_0001$$$::A detour would be good too if she wants to talk.[lr]::
8111::$$$message_0058_0002_0002$$$::"Um... [cacheimage storage=桜制服08h(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=桜制服08h(中) time=300]Can we go to the shopping district in Miyama if that's okay?"[lr]::
8112::$$$message_0058_0002_0003$$$::"Mm, you're fine with that?"[lr]::
8113::$$$message_0058_0002_0004$$$::Sakura takes her phone out of her pocket and looks at the time.::
8114::$$$message_0058_0003_0000$$$::"Yes, we would make it in time for the evening limited-time sale!"[lr]::
8115::$$$message_0058_0003_0001$$$::"I see, then I'll gladly go."[lr]::
8116::$$$message_0058_0003_0002$$$::Sales are more advantageous with more people.[lr]::
8117::$$$message_0058_0003_0003$$$::Sakura nods, and we hurry along the path[line len=2]::
8118::$$$message_0058_0004_0000$$$::"Phew..."[lr]::
8119::$$$message_0058_0004_0001$$$::We come outside after being caught in the limited-time offer fight.[lr]::
8120::$$$message_0058_0004_0002$$$::It must be because it's the Saturday before the consecutive holidays, that the cashier was busy with customers stocking up on things.::
8121::$$$message_0058_0005_0000$$$::"We were able to get some good things, huh, Senpai?"[lr]::
8122::$$$message_0058_0005_0001$$$::"Yeah, it was a good deal. Two cartons of eggs and two cartons of milk each, huh?"[lr]::
8123::$$$message_0058_0005_0002$$$::"Haha, sorry for making you carry the shopping."[lr]::
8124::$$$message_0058_0005_0003$$$::"Don't worry about it, it's all our ingredients. Do you want me to carry yours if it's heavy, too?"[lr]::
8125::$$$message_0058_0005_0004$$$::"This is nothing. But I'm glad you're with me."::
8126::$$$message_0058_0006_0000$$$::We walk through the crowded shopping district, both carrying around heavy shopping bags.[lr]::
8127::$$$message_0058_0006_0001$$$::Since we are the backbones of our kitchen, we naturally talk about household topics.::
8128::$$$message_0058_0007_0000$$$::"Baking a cake might be good if we have a lot of eggs and milk."[lr]::
8129::$$$message_0058_0007_0001$$$::"Steamed egg custard would be good, too."[lr]::
8130::$$$message_0058_0007_0002$$$::"We use a lot of milk, don't we? Since everyone drinks it during breakfast and lunch."[lr]::
8131::$$$message_0058_0007_0003$$$::"You drink a lot too, Sakura."::
8132::$$$message_0058_0008_0000$$$::"Do I? But my stomach is strong, so I can drink it cold without getting a stomachache."[lr]::
8133::$$$message_0058_0008_0001$$$::Heheheh... She doesn't seem to notice that Tohsaka glares at her in a way that says, "What are you going to do if your boobs grow any bigger?"::
8134::$$$message_0058_0009_0000$$$::"Oh?"[lr]::
8135::$$$message_0058_0009_0001$$$::"Hm?"[lr]::
8136::$$$message_0058_0009_0002$$$::Sakura stops and looks towards Edomaeya.[lr]::
8137::$$$message_0058_0009_0003$$$::Beyond the counter, freshly baked obanyakis[line len=2]Japanese stuffed pancakes[line len=2]are arranged nicely.[lr]::
8138::$$$message_0058_0009_0004$$$::The sweet scent that comes drifting in the air stimulates my empty stomach.::
8139::$$$message_0058_0010_0000$$$::"Sakura, which one do you wanna eat?"[lr]::
8140::$$$message_0058_0010_0001$$$::"I-I'm good..."[lr]::
8141::$$$message_0058_0010_0002$$$::"You've had practice since lunch, right? Aren't you hungry from exercising that much?"[lr]::
8142::$$$message_0058_0010_0003$$$::"Well, yes..."::
8143::$$$message_0058_0011_0000$$$::"B-but it's before dinner!"[lr]::
8144::$$$message_0058_0011_0001$$$::"If you eat a little, it can digest while you're cooking dinner at home."[lr]::
8145::$$$message_0058_0011_0002$$$::"T-that's not true."[lr]::
8146::$$$message_0058_0011_0003$$$::"You think so? Hmm, I would think you should be a hearty eater if you're a martial artist."[lr]::
8147::$$$message_0058_0011_0004$$$::"Um... B-besides, I have to refrain from sweets or else, you know, for various reasons!"::
8148::$$$message_0058_0012_0000$$$::Flustered, Sakura tries to come up with refusals, but doesn't take her eyes off the obanyaki.[lr]::
8149::$$$message_0058_0012_0001$$$::I should make an obvious reason here.::
8150::$$$message_0058_0013_0000$$$::"Well, I'm actually kinda hungry."[lr]::
8151::$$$message_0058_0013_0001$$$::"Huh...?"[lr]::
8152::$$$message_0058_0013_0002$$$::"But I don't want to eat by myself, so I would appreciate if you joined me."[lr]::
8153::$$$message_0058_0013_0003$$$::"..."::
8154::$$$message_0058_0014_0000$$$::"Senpai... That kind of consideration makes me even more embarrassed..."[lr]::
8155::$$$message_0058_0014_0001$$$::"Well, it's not just for us, but it'll be a souvenir for Saber and Fuji-nee too."[lr]::
8156::$$$message_0058_0014_0002$$$::"Oh, wow. If it's for that reason, that's perfect!"[lr]::
8157::$$$message_0058_0014_0003$$$::"All right. I'll be holding the bags, so can you go choose?"[lr]::
8158::$$$message_0058_0014_0004$$$::"Yes!"::
8159::$$$message_0058_0015_0000$$$::"Thanks, Sakura."[lr]::
8160::$$$message_0058_0015_0001$$$::"Haha, they're freshly baked and warm."[lr]::
8161::$$$message_0058_0015_0002$$$::"Yeah. I feel bad for Saber and Fuji-nee, but let's eat them while they're warm. As someone in charge of the kitchen, I can't bear to watch the taste deteriorate in front of my eyes."[lr]::
8162::$$$message_0058_0015_0003$$$::"Yes. Just a head start."::
8163::$$$message_0058_0016_0000$$$::It's almost as if Sakura's hesitation from earlier was a lie, as she obediently opens the seal of the paper bag.::
8164::$$$message_0058_0017_0000$$$::"Do you like red bean paste or cream?"[lr]::
8165::$$$message_0058_0017_0001$$$::"Red bean paste... Sakura, can you hold one of the bags?"::
8166::$$$message_0058_0018_0000$$$::Sakura brings the obanyaki she took out of the paper bag close to her nose and inhales the scent.[lr]::
8167::$$$message_0058_0018_0001$$$::"This is probably red bean paste."[lr]::
8168::$$$message_0058_0018_0002$$$::"I see... Hold on, let me set my stuff down. My hands are full[line len=2]"[lr]::
8169::$$$message_0058_0018_0003$$$::"Here, have it while it's hot."[lr]::
8170::$$$message_0058_0018_0004$$$::Sakura brings the obanyaki in her hand to my mouth.[lr]::
8171::$$$message_0058_0018_0005$$$::The warm steam caresses my face and tickles the inside of my nose.::
8172::$$$message_0058_0019_0000$$$::"...Sakura, could it be[line len=2]"[lr]::
8173::$$$message_0058_0019_0001$$$::"Open wide and say ahh, Senpai."[lr]::
8174::$$$message_0058_0019_0002$$$::...S-so, that's what she meant after all!::
8175::$$$message_0058_0020_0000$$$::"Isn't it good?"[lr]::
8176::$$$message_0058_0020_0001$$$::"Hnng... Sakura, this kind of stuff doesn't embarrass you?"[lr]::
8177::$$$message_0058_0020_0002$$$::"Hehe."[lr]::
8178::$$$message_0058_0020_0003$$$::Sakura is in a good mood, but I'm so self-conscious of the gazes around me that I can't tell the taste.::
8179::$$$message_0058_0021_0000$$$::"I...have been going to this shopping district since I was a kid, so there's people I know everywhere..."[lr]::
8180::$$$message_0058_0021_0001$$$::"Really?"[lr]::
8181::$$$message_0058_0021_0002$$$::"Yeah. You're just not embarrassed because you don't think you'll run into anyone."::
8182::$$$message_0058_0022_0000$$$::"Oh, Matou-senpai! Are you going home right now?"[lr]::
8183::$$$message_0058_0022_0001$$$::"...Mrgh!"::
8184::$$$message_0058_0023_0000$$$::"Oh, Miss Sato. Are you helping out your family?"[lr]::
8185::$$$message_0058_0023_0001$$$::"Yes. Um, is the person next you..."[lr]::
8186::$$$message_0058_0023_0002$$$::"Hnng! [wvl][shock vmax=10 time=300 count=3]Hnng!"[lr]::
8187::$$$message_0058_0023_0003$$$::"Hehe, of course not."[lr]::
8188::$$$message_0058_0023_0004$$$::"Ahh, I feel bad for Mitsuzuri! Haha."[lr]::
8189::$$$message_0058_0023_0005$$$::"Hm? Why do you feel bad for Minori?"[lr]::
8190::$$$message_0058_0023_0006$$$::"Hnngg!"::
8191::$$$message_0058_0024_0000$$$::"Oh, sorry for interrupting. I'll excuse myself."[lr]::
8192::$$$message_0058_0024_0001$$$::"Oh, hold on. Can you take a picture for us?"[lr]::
8193::$$$message_0058_0024_0002$$$::"That's a cute phone! Okay, get closer together please. Cheese!"[lr]::
8194::$$$message_0058_0024_0003$$$::"Hnng!?"::
8195::$$$message_0058_0025_0000$$$::Sakura's underclassman looks back at us many times as she leaves.[lr]::
8196::$$$message_0058_0025_0001$$$::"...Oof... I'm about to die from embarrassment..."[lr]::
8197::$$$message_0058_0025_0002$$$::"I'm embarrassed, too. But more than that, I'm happy, so please turn a blind eye to this."[lr]::
8198::$$$message_0058_0025_0003$$$::She laughs cheerfully.[lr]::
8199::$$$message_0058_0025_0004$$$::...Khh. I can't say anything if she makes such a face.::
8200::$$$message_0058_0026_0000$$$::"Senpai, say ahh.[lr]::
8201::$$$message_0058_0026_0001$$$::Cream is good too. It's melted and warm."[lr]::
8202::$$$message_0058_0026_0002$$$::"Nah, I can't help but feel like cream is the wrong way to go."[lr]::
8203::$$$message_0058_0026_0003$$$::"Hey, that's being a picky eater."[lr]::
8204::$$$message_0058_0026_0004$$$::I still get nervous from Sakura's affectionate voice.[lr]::
8205::$$$message_0058_0026_0005$$$::The person with the most common sense in our house shows a different side of her when we're out in public with just the two of us.::
8206::$$$message_0058_0027_0000$$$::"What's wrong?"[lr]::
8207::$$$message_0058_0027_0001$$$::"No, nothing..."[lr]::
8208::$$$message_0058_0027_0002$$$::"Hehe, you were surprised at the archery range too, weren't you?"[lr]::
8209::$$$message_0058_0027_0003$$$::"Ah... I looked like an idiot, didn't I?"::
8210::$$$message_0058_0028_0000$$$::"That's not true.[lr]::
8211::$$$message_0058_0028_0001$$$::The club is focused on the fall tournament right now, so I can't shift gears quite so fast. That's probably why I surprised you."[lr]::
8212::$$$message_0058_0028_0002$$$::"The fall tournament, huh... It's already that time of the year, isn't it?"[lr]::
8213::$$$message_0058_0028_0003$$$::I quit the kyudo club in the summer of my first year, so one of the regrets I had was that I couldn't be in the tournament.::
8214::$$$message_0058_0029_0000$$$::"Who's going to be the representative this year?"[lr]::
8215::$$$message_0058_0029_0001$$$::"Oh, you're curious too?"::
8216::$$$message_0058_0030_0000$$$::"From the third years, Mitsuzuri-senpai, Kudou-senpai, and Kumehara-senpai!"[lr]::
8217::$$$message_0058_0030_0001$$$::"Oh, those members should be a safe bet... The only problem is Mitsuzuri's inconsistency."[lr]::
8218::$$$message_0058_0030_0002$$$::"And from the second years are Igaki as well as me!"[lr]::
8219::$$$message_0058_0030_0003$$$::"Oh, you're a representative, too. Good, good."[lr]::
8220::$$$message_0058_0030_0004$$$::"Yes, I am the captain after all."::
8221::$$$message_0058_0031_0000$$$::"I see. Didn't Fuji-nee also say that becoming national champions is her dream?"[lr]::
8222::$$$message_0058_0031_0001$$$::"Ms. Fujimura is, you know, overly positive."[lr]::
8223::$$$message_0058_0031_0002$$$::"You can also say she's optimistic. So, what about your confidence as captain?"[lr]::
8224::$$$message_0058_0031_0003$$$::"My confidence? Let's see..."[lr]::
8225::$$$message_0058_0031_0004$$$::Sakura bites on an obanyaki and thinks.::
8226::$$$message_0058_0032_0000$$$::"I think we can somehow make regionals."[lr]::
8227::$$$message_0058_0032_0001$$$::"That's bold, Sakura. I'll be watching over you from below the platform when you get awarded at the schoolwide assembly."[lr]::
8228::$$$message_0058_0032_0002$$$::"Uh... M-me in front of all the students?"[lr]::
8229::$$$message_0058_0032_0003$$$::"Well, you are the captain.[lr]::
8230::$$$message_0058_0032_0004$$$::Oh yeah, Shinji isn't one of the third years' representatives. What happened to him?"::
8231::$$$message_0058_0033_0000$$$::"My big brother?"[lr]::
8232::$$$message_0058_0033_0001$$$::"Yeah, he was last year's representative player, right?"[lr]::
8233::$$$message_0058_0033_0002$$$::"He's deciding to retire because he's a third year, so he doesn't come to practice anymore."[lr]::
8234::$$$message_0058_0033_0003$$$::"Oh... I didn't know."[lr]::
8235::$$$message_0058_0033_0004$$$::Come to think of it, I haven't seen Shinji at the archery range since this summer.::
8236::$$$message_0058_0034_0000$$$::"I invited him suggesting he show up once in a while, but he's been like that."[lr]::
8237::$$$message_0058_0034_0001$$$::She talks about Shinji with a laid-back smile.[lr]::
8238::$$$message_0058_0034_0002$$$::Even the fact that she is able to voice her opinions on Shinji is hard to believe compared to the old Sakura.::
8239::$$$message_0058_0035_0000$$$::"...No getting mad and throwing hands, right?"[lr]::
8240::$$$message_0058_0035_0001$$$::"No, of course not...[lr]::
8241::$$$message_0058_0035_0002$$$::Mitsuzuri-senpai says that I'm still too soft and that I need to be harder on him, but I'm not that strong, yet."[lr]::
8242::$$$message_0058_0035_0003$$$::...No, not you, Sakura.::
8243::$$$message_0058_0036_0000$$$::"Hehe, it's okay.[lr]::
8244::$$$message_0058_0036_0001$$$::My big brother isn't the person he used to be, and I'm not the person I used to be."[lr]::
8245::$$$message_0058_0036_0002$$$::Sakura smiles, as she munches on her obanyaki.[lr]::
8246::$$$message_0058_0036_0003$$$::She shows no signs of the days she was frightened and cowered.::
8247::$$$message_0058_0037_0000$$$::Sakura talked about a lot of occurrences to me as we walked.[lr]::
8248::$$$message_0058_0037_0001$$$::The time she surprised the club members at their training camp with her cooking skills.[lr]::
8249::$$$message_0058_0037_0002$$$::The time she was invited by her underclassmen to go bowling for the first time.::
8250::$$$message_0058_0038_0000$$$::The time after practice, when she taught the club members the massage she was good at, and how they were pleased.[lr]::
8251::$$$message_0058_0038_0001$$$::The time they captured Mitsuzuri's little brother, who was embarrassed of getting massaged, and made sure he got a thorough one.[lr]::
8252::$$$message_0058_0038_0002$$$::The time Mitsuzuri reported gleefully about how her little brother was tossing about from being sore all over.::
8253::$$$message_0058_0039_0000$$$::Sakura stops suddenly.[lr]::
8254::$$$message_0058_0039_0001$$$::I also stop, and we overlook the town in the sunset from above together.::
8255::$$$message_0058_0040_0000$$$::"...This is the first time, Senpai."[lr]::
8256::$$$message_0058_0040_0001$$$::"The first time?"[lr]::
8257::$$$message_0058_0040_0002$$$::"Yes, going home with you like this, making small talk together, eating while walking together... Everything is a first."::
8258::$$$message_0058_0041_0000$$$::I see.[lr]::
8259::$$$message_0058_0041_0001$$$::Sakura coming over has become a daily occurrence, but we had never gone home together since we both have club practice or work.::
8260::$$$message_0058_0042_0000$$$::"My wish has been granted."[lr]::
8261::$$$message_0058_0042_0001$$$::"Your wish?"[lr]::
8262::$$$message_0058_0042_0002$$$::"Yes, talking to you about myself, like my friends and club... That was my dream."[lr]::
8263::$$$message_0058_0042_0003$$$::"..."::
8264::$$$message_0058_0043_0000$$$::"I have a lot of dreams like that. All kinds of things that I want to do with you, the dreams that I've wished for... Am I greedy?"[lr]::
8265::$$$message_0058_0043_0001$$$::"No, you're not. I'm glad that you have dreams that you can attain."::
8266::$$$message_0058_0044_0000$$$::"Hehe..."[lr]::
8267::$$$message_0058_0044_0001$$$::She must be blushing, as she sticks a piece of her obanyaki out to me as if to cover my mouth.[lr]::
8268::$$$message_0058_0044_0002$$$::"Mrgh, this is cream..."[lr]::
8269::$$$message_0058_0044_0003$$$::Sakura is too focused on stepping on the long shadows cast by the sunset to notice.[lr]::
8270::$$$message_0058_0044_0004$$$::"I'm so happy."[lr]::
8271::$$$message_0058_0044_0005$$$::...I go quiet and finish the rest.[lr]::
8272::$$$message_0058_0044_0006$$$::The taste isn't as bad as I thought.::
8273::$$$message_0058_0045_0000$$$::"Thank you for keeping me company today, Senpai."[lr]::
8274::$$$message_0058_0045_0001$$$::"Are you fine with such a cheap thing?"[lr]::
8275::$$$message_0058_0045_0002$$$::"Hehe, then we should dress up and eat somewhere fancy next time."::
8276::$$$message_0058_0046_0000$$$::...Hm. Is that a high-grade request like an upscale restaurant or a week-long castle tour trip in Europe?[lr]::
8277::$$$message_0058_0046_0001$$$::Y-yeah, that's realistic enough.[lr]::
8278::$$$message_0058_0046_0002$$$::That'd be difficult right now, but I should be able to grant it if I get the chance... Right?::
8279::$$$message_0058_0047_0000$$$::"All right. An extravagant meal with classical music.[lr]::
8280::$$$message_0058_0047_0001$$$::Just wait, I'll make it happen."[lr]::
8281::$$$message_0058_0047_0002$$$::"Okay. I'll be waiting."::

